;Animation of Jae Hoon (by Kazuya)
;Use with Jae.SFF 
;AIR file V2

; groupno, imageno, offx, offy, duration [, flags]
; if duration is -1, then frame is displayed indefinitely.
; for flags (optional), H - horizonal flip, V - vertical flip.

